<title>USA: Dow drops more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow drops more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 100 points in late trading on Wednesday on profit taking following the market's inability to snap through the 8,000-point mark earlier in the day.</p>
<p>At 3:02 p.m. EDT (1902 GMT), the Dow index was off 100.88 points at 7,861.43.</p>
